# Module-level functions and variables (Haxe 5).
=== initial
@expect-output 5
--- Main.hx
import Util;

class Main {
	static function main() {
		trace(Util.twice(2) + 1);
	}
}
--- Util.hx
function twice(x:Int) return x * 2;

=== change module-level function
@expect-output 7
--- Util.hx
function twice(x:Int) return x * 3;
